### Test agregar miembro al equipo
POST http://localhost/v1/api/team/{{team_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "role": "creator"
}

### Alternativa con datos diferentes
POST http://localhost/v1/api/team/{{team_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
